{"speciesId":284,"names":{"fr":"Maskadra","es":"Masquerain","en":"Masquerain","ja":"アメモース"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"MASQUERAIN intimidates enemies with the eyelike patterns on its antennas. This POKéMON flaps its four wings to freely fly in any direction - even sideways and backwards - as if it were a helicopter."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"MASQUERAIN’s antennas have eyelike patterns that usually give it an angry look. If the “eyes” are droopy and appear sad, it is said to be a sign that a heavy rainfall is on its way."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It intimidates foes with the large eyelike patterns on its antennae. Because it can’t fly if its wings get wet, it shelters itself from rain under large trees and eaves."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"The antennae have distinctive patterns that look like eyes. When it rains, they grow heavy, making flight impossible."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"The antennae have distinctive patterns that look like eyes. When it rains, they grow heavy, making flight impossible."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its antennae have eye patterns on them. Its four wings enable it to hover and fly in any direction."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Its antennae have eye patterns on them. Its four wings enable it to hover and fly in any direction."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its antennae have eye patterns on them. Its four wings enable it to hover and fly in any direction."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It flaps its four wings to hover and fly freely in any direction-- to and fro and sideways."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It flaps its four wings to hover and fly freely in any direction-- to and fro and sideways."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Des motifs en forme d’yeux ornent ses antennes. Ses 4 ailes l’aident à voler dans toutes les directions."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its antennae have eye patterns on them. Its four wings enable it to hover and fly in any direction."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Des motifs en forme d’yeux ornent ses antennes. Ses 4 ailes l’aident à voler dans toutes les directions."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its antennae have eye patterns on them. Its four wings enable it to hover and fly in any direction."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Its antennae have eye patterns on them. Its four wings enable it to hover and fly in any direction."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Its antennae have eye patterns on them. Its four wings enable it to hover and fly in any direction."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Des motifs en forme d’yeux ornent ses antennes. Ses quatre ailes l’aident à voler dans toutes les directions."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Sus antenas tienen dibujos de ojos, mientras que sus alas le permiten volar en cualquier dirección."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its antennae have eye patterns on them. Its four wings enable it to hover and fly in any direction."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"目玉模様の 触角を 持つ。 ４枚の 羽で 浮かび上がり 前後左右に 動くことができる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ses quatre ailes permettent à ce Pokémon de voler dans toutes les directions."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Sus cuatro alas le permiten volar en cualquier dirección a su antojo."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It flaps its four wings to hover and fly freely in any direction--to and fro and sideways."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"４枚の 羽で 浮かび上がり 前後 左右 自由自在に 飛び回る ことが できる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Maskadra intimide ses ennemis grâce aux motifs en forme de regard sur ses antennes. En battant des ailes, ce Pokémon peut voler librement dans toutes les directions, même latéralement ou à reculons."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Masquerain intimida a sus enemigos con los ojos que tiene dibujados en las antenas. Este Pokémon bate las cuatro alas que tiene para volar libremente en cualquier dirección, hasta de lado y hacia atrás, como un helicóptero."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Masquerain intimidates enemies with the eyelike patterns on its antennas. This Pokémon flaps its four wings to freely fly in any direction—even sideways and backwards—as if it were a helicopter."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"触角の 目玉 模様 で 敵を 威嚇。 ４枚の 羽を 使い ヘリコプターの ように 空中で 前後左右 自由に 進める。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Les antennes de Maskadra ont la forme de grands yeux qui lancent un regard malfaisant. Si ces « yeux » sont tristes, cela signifie qu’un déluge se prépare."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Masquerain tiene unas antenas con ojos dibujados que le dan aspecto de estar enfadado. Si tiene los “ojos” medio cerrados y con aspecto triste, es probable que esté a punto de caer un buen aguacero."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Masquerain’s antennas have eyelike patterns that usually give it an angry look. If the “eyes” are droopy and appear sad, it is said to be a sign that a heavy rainfall is on its way."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"怒った 表情の 目玉 模様が 悲しそうに 垂れ下がっている ときは 夕立ちの 降り出す 前兆と いわれる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Ses antennes semblables à des yeux servent à intimider ses ennemis, et ses quatre ailes lui permettent de voler dans toutes les directions."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Amenaza a sus enemigos con las grandes pupilas de sus antenas. Sus cuatro alas le permiten volar en cualquier dirección."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It intimidates enemies with the eye-like patterns on its antennae. Its four wings allow it to fly in any direction."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"触角に ある 目玉模様で 敵を いかく。 ４枚の 羽で 前後左右に 飛びまわる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Ses ailes et ses antennes tolèrent mal l’humidité. En cas de pluie, ce Pokémon se réfugie là où le soleil brille pour y faire sécher son corps."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Sus alas y antenas son muy sensibles a la humedad. Cuando deja de llover se dirige volando hacia el sol para secarlas."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Its wings and antennae don’t cope well with moisture. After a rain, it faces sunward to dry off."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"羽や 触角は 湿気が 苦手。 雨上がりには 太陽の ほうを 向いて 身体を 乾かす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Ses protubérances en forme d’yeux servent à intimider ses ennemis. Si cela ne marche pas, il utilise ses quatre ailes pour s’enfuir."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Intimida a sus enemigos con las grandes pupilas de sus antenas. Si esto no funciona, bate sus cuatro alas para huir."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Masquerain intimidates enemies with the eyelike patterns of its eyespots. If that doesn’t work, it deftly makes its escape on its set of four wings."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"目玉模様で 敵を 威嚇。 それで ダメなら ４枚の ハネを 使って 器用に 逃げまわるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Ses antennes en forme d’ailes absorbent facilement l’humidité. Par temps de pluie, il attend patiemment au creux d’un arbre."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Sus grandes antenas en forma de ojos tienden a absorber humedad. Los días de lluvia, se refugia en cavidades de los árboles y espera paciente."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its thin, winglike antennae are highly absorbent. It waits out rainy days in tree hollows."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"薄い ハネの ような 触角は 湿気を 吸いやすい。 雨の 日は 木の ウロなどで じっと 過ごす。"}],"varieties":[{"id":284,"moves":[{"name":"gust","learns":[[5,"level-up",26],[6,"level-up",26],[7,"level-up",26],[8,"level-up",22],[9,"level-up",22],[10,"level-up",22],[11,"level-up",22],[12,"level-u